{"name": "Dicewood", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/7f113ff96eb5251508774718f193d81d.poster.avif?t=1785933593\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/7f113ff96eb5251508774718f193d81d.webm?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/7f113ff96eb5251508774718f193d81d.mp4?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dicewood is a fantasy horror roguelike deck-builder where adorable forest animals band together to escape. Dozens of animals still remain in the forest, each with its own unique ability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine animal abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend the rules with consumables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploit every enemy's weakness </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/8774193c5c16f98180e636c53d479a22.poster.avif?t=1785933593\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/8774193c5c16f98180e636c53d479a22.webm?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/8774193c5c16f98180e636c53d479a22.mp4?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anything can happen along the road:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamble against impossible odds for new equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sacrifice some to empower others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search the spiderweb for whatever struggles inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade bones for sacred relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help others... or flee in fear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/eebe44443e01e801f178320bd2a4f72b.poster.avif?t=1785933593\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/eebe44443e01e801f178320bd2a4f72b.webm?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/eebe44443e01e801f178320bd2a4f72b.mp4?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meta Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every run, you'll grow stronger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock cages to rescue new animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon the spirits of the fallen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bargain with the witch for powerful artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/aa002aec15c4600c1ada9be2008ea188.poster.avif?t=1785933593\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/aa002aec15c4600c1ada9be2008ea188.webm?t=1785933593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"htt